#question(title: [Symmetric difference], centered: true)[
  Given two sets $A$ and $B$, we define
  - $A without B = {x in A thick : thick x in.not B}$
  - $A triangle.t B = (A without B) union(B without A)$

  #v(1fr)

  Let
  - $C_1 = {" students under 18 "}$
  - $C_2 = {" students born in Ontario "}$

  #v(1fr)

  What is the set $C_1 triangle.t C_2$?

  #v(1fr)
]
